WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:03.135
I asked Jesse this question
very, very early on,

00:00:03.135 --> 00:00:04.838
I said, you know, um...

00:00:05.738 --> 00:00:07.974
I said,
"Does he love his children?"

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.377
And, uh, the answer
was a redoubtable,

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:14.180
"Oh yes, yes, he really does
love his children."

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.715
So given that...

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:20.420
the fact that he is locked into
his children in that way,

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.821
you realize that, um,

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:26.125
his children are just,
a sort of deep,

00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:28.094
deep disappointment to him.

